## Rail

::bg{location="deck" time="dawn"}
@narrator: For once, Ilo climbs the ladder on his own.
@sefa{emotion="delighted"}: He swam! Brann, he swam up!
@brann{emotion="wry"}: So he did. {{@fathoms}} fathoms and back. Don't make a habit of surprising me.
